@startuml
title C08 Gauge forms, latest value, and limits
' Traces: OMCT-C08-L2-03.01, OMCT-C08-L2-03.02, OMCT-C08-L2-03.03

participant "Gauge View" as GaugeView
participant "Gauge Configuration" as GaugeConfig
participant "@cupola/core Telemetry API" as TelemetryApi
participant "@cupola/core Telemetry Value Formatter" as ValueFormatter
participant "@cupola/core Limit Evaluation" as LimitEvaluation

GaugeView -> GaugeConfig: read form and range source
activate GaugeConfig
GaugeConfig --> GaugeView: form, bounds mode, limit mode
deactivate GaugeConfig
alt manual bounds configured
    GaugeView -> GaugeView: use configured minimum and maximum
else telemetry-derived limits configured
    GaugeView -> LimitEvaluation: evaluateLimits(source)
    activate LimitEvaluation
    LimitEvaluation --> GaugeView: minimum, maximum, low limit, high limit
    deactivate LimitEvaluation
end
GaugeView -> GaugeView: render selected gauge form
note right of GaugeView
Implemented forms are filled dial, needle dial, vertical meter, inverted vertical meter, and horizontal meter.
end note
GaugeView -> TelemetryApi: subscribe(source, latest)
activate TelemetryApi
TelemetryApi --> GaugeView: unsubscribe handle
deactivate TelemetryApi
TelemetryApi -> GaugeView: callback(numeric datum)
activate GaugeView
GaugeView -> ValueFormatter: format(range value)
activate ValueFormatter
ValueFormatter --> GaugeView: formatted value
deactivate ValueFormatter
GaugeView -> GaugeView: display value at gauge position
GaugeView --> TelemetryApi: datum rendered
deactivate GaugeView
@enduml
